  "body": "Set in an elevated position in Millwater, this brand new 5-bedroom home enjoys beautiful sea views and a wide, open outlook from some of its best living spaces.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 272sqm on a 524sqm elevated section, the home has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, with generous proportions, multiple living areas and excellent indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, filled with natural light and opening directly onto the spacious Kwila deck. The elevated position makes the outdoor area particularly enjoyable, with a broad outlook and sea views providing a beautiful backdrop for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\n• Five generously sized bedrooms, including a ground-floor guest master with ensuite\r\n• Sunny open-plan living, dining and kitchen with excellent flow to the outdoor area\r\n• Large Kwila deck, ideal for entertaining, outdoor dining or simply enjoying the views\r\n• Well-appointed kitchen with engineered stone benchtops, modern appliances and plenty of storage\r\n• Walk-in scullery providing additional workspace and storage\r\n• Separate upstairs sitting area with a coffee bar, perfect as a second living space\r\n• Spacious master bedroom upstairs with beautiful sea views. Comes with large walk-in wardrobe and ensuite with double basins and a generous shower\r\n• Family bathroom upstairs plus guest WC downstairs\r\n• 10-year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nConveniently located in Millwater, close to schools, shops, cafes and the shopping centre, with easy motorway access for commuting.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
